    "text": "If the greatest value of the term independent of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to:",
